  ],
  "duration_s": 639.339002,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国历史上最有文化气息的名山都有哪些吗？上集，咱们聊了黄山、雁荡山、天台山、青城山、庐山这集，直接揭开谜底，看看前五名深厚到什么程度，尤其是排在榜首的那座没有皇帝仪仗的大气味，也没有满山庙宇的香火味，却用一位大先生的学问，让山里一草一木都有了几摇头。老规矩开讲之前，劳烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁。在听第五名五台山，山西忻州五台山，您一定听过中国佛教四大名山。他排头一个五座台，顶平平的像五只，托着天的手掌，北台夜斗峰三千零六十一米，是华北屋脊，相传这里是文殊菩萨的道场。东汉就有人盖世，唐朝最盛的时候，山里三百多座寺院，今天还有四十多座。您夏天上山山下热的冒汗，到了台顶，凉风一吹才懂他为什么叫清凉山。山里的南禅寺，是一座唐朝的木头大殿，一千两百多年了，是中国现存最老的木结构建筑。别处的唐朝早成了书里的字，这儿的唐朝还稳稳立着，您说，这是不是活的历史？第四名，嵩山、河南郑州。很多人以为嵩山就是个练少林武功的地方。其实他真正厉害的底色是儒释道三家。在咱们中原府第扎下的老根，三十六亿年的石头帝制三千多年，历朝历代祭天的地方，全国最早的汉朝石阙砖塔全都在这立着。您要是站在中岳庙又大又红的宫墙和大柏树底下，脚踩的老砖头耳朵，听着少林寺远远传来的撞钟声，闭上眼就能摸到咱们老祖宗那股厚重的脉搏。少林寺在这开创了禅宗宋朝的大先生们，在松阳书院摆开桌子讲学，读书明理，修心修德，全在这磨合了上千年，成了天地当中最稳当的一座文化。大靠山，第三名，武当山湖北十堰。如果说嵩山是三家同住，武当山，就是把整座山修成一座道观。明朝永乐，十年朱棣一声令下，征调三十万人，修了十二年，在七十二封之间盖起九宫八卦。当年有句话，北建紫禁城难修，武当主封天柱峰，一千六百多米峰顶立的一座金殿，通体铜铸鎏金六百多年。过去，雷雨天常被雷火裹住变身，却一点没坏人们，叫他雷火练电。您顺着山路往上公关，一座接一座藏在悬崖和山坳里，跟山的形状严丝合缝。一座山被一个王朝拿国力雕成了一件作品，您说这气魄当不当得起文化二字？第二名，泰山山东泰安。论名气，论地位，很多人以为第一名非他莫属，五岳之首，海拔一千五百四十五米，不算最高。可从秦始皇开始一代代帝王，排着队上山封禅汉武帝去了，好几趟唐玄宗，宋真宗也都去了。孔子说，登太山而小天下。杜甫望着他，写下一览众山小，山上磨牙石刻一千多处，从山脚到山顶，六千多级台阶，您一步一步往上爬。腿酸的直打颤，爬到玉皇顶，日出一漏，什么泪都忘了，别的山是拿来看的。泰山是拿来托付的，历代人把对天对国、对自己的叛头一块块刻在了山石上。一座山成了一个民族的精神靠山，您说这分量重不重？那第一名到底是哪儿？先别急，聊到这儿，我先唠几句心里话。我发现经常有朋友留言说，年轻时候忙，没空出门，现在退休有空了，想去走走，可不知道先去哪儿去了，看什么。还有朋友说年纪上来了，泰山、黄山这样的台阶爬不动，有没有不用费劲，爬山也能看懂的名声。还有带孙子孙女儿的，想给孩子讲讲这些山水背后的古人典故，可自己也说不全。您看咱们这个年纪看景，不光是图个热闹，更想知道这背后有什么文化讲究。可这些东西在手机上划完就忘上网，查一堆乱七八糟的翻大部头，史书又看的眼睛疼。前阵子我翻到一本书，正好解决这个问题，叫大美中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方。他把全中国最值得去的一百零一个地方挑出来，分成五块自然奇观，文明印记、烟火，人间秘境，寻踪，人间天堂。咱们今天聊的这些名山书里头，一个地方接一个地方，讲怎么来的，有什么典故？帝王在这儿干了什么？文人墨客又在这儿寄托了什么心性，几分钟，一个地方讲的明明白白，呼印的特别透亮。一页翻开就是一幅大画，我自己是这么用的，能去的地方出门前翻一翻到了地方，心里有底，看的就不是冷石头，是活故事暂时去不了的，就着图文慢慢看，也算去过了。摆在茶几上，孙辈来了，翻两页，长见识不说，写作文也正好用得上。老两口晚上翻翻商量，明年去哪儿比刷手机舒坦多了，房子会旧积蓄会花完。可老祖宗留下来的文化底蕴，传多少代都贬不了职，这根脉一旦断了，可就不好接了，趁现在还能买到给自己，也给下一代留一份儿，说我搁商品橱窗了。感兴趣的朋友点开我的头像，进入主页进去看看，暂时走不出去，咱就把大好河山装进屋里，好说回正题揭晓。第一名，武夷山，福建南平，为什么是他他不在五岳之列？没有一位帝王在他头上封过禅，可前面九座山各占一块的东西，他一座山全装下了南宋。一位叫朱熹的读书人，在山里舞曲的大饮屏风下，盖起武夷京社收徒讲学，还写下十首五一诏歌。他在这儿讲的学问就是理学。后来，他著的四叔从元朝起成了科举考场的标准，一直管到清末，将近六百年。中国的读书人没有一个绕的过去。可武夷山不只是书斋，九曲溪绕着三十六封九十九颜留山崖上刻着四百多处古人留下的字，宋朝、苏轼、范仲淹都写诗夸过他的茶。元朝朝廷干脆在山里设了御茶园红茶的鼻祖，正山小主也是从这山里出来的。您坐上竹筏，顺着九曲溪飘下来，一边是山，一边是水，手里端着一杯颜茶，抬头是食客。耳边仿佛有人在念书、读书、喝茶、写诗、刻字看山不是一样一样，摆的是全藏在了一起。一九九九年，他被列为世界文化与自然双遗产。他排第一，不是因为名气最大，而是因为他最完整。别的山是文化，住进了山里，武夷山是山和文化，长成了彼此的样子。从十座山讲完了黄山，让画家拜他为师，雁荡山被沈括读出了山水的道理，天台山容下了佛道，两家青城山把清净修成了安庐山，一座山装了半部尸史。五台山立的一千两百年的唐朝嵩山，让佛道如同住武当山，是一个王朝，拿国力雕出来的泰山，是一个民族的精神靠山，可只有武夷山没有风扇，不靠帝王，确把理学、茶、诗文、石刻和山水包在了一起。前面几座山比的是名气是四冠，是谁来过？他比的是文化，有没有长进山的骨头里，您说什么才叫文化气息？山不是因为有名才有文化气息，是因为有人把心安在了里山，也把人养成了他的样子。最后问问您，这十座名山，您去过哪几座？最想去的是哪一座？刚才说的那本大美中国，我哥商品橱窗了，点开我的头像，进入主页里就能找到喜欢山水文化的朋友，别错过。想听更多藏在山水里的中国故事。点个关注，咱们下回接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00001",
      "start_ms": 310,
      "end_ms": 4950,
      "text": "您知道中国历史上最有文化气息的名山都有哪些吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00002",
      "start_ms": 5630,
      "end_ms": 6210,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00003",
      "start_ms": 6230,
      "end_ms": 12370,
      "text": "咱们聊了黄山、雁荡山、天台山、青城山、庐山这集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00004",
      "start_ms": 12410,
      "end_ms": 13630,
      "text": "直接揭开谜底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00005",
      "start_ms": 14010,
      "end_ms": 16430,
      "text": "看看前五名深厚到什么程度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00006",
      "start_ms": 16830,
      "end_ms": 21270,
      "text": "尤其是排在榜首的那座没有皇帝仪仗的大气味，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00007",
      "start_ms": 21670,
      "end_ms": 24030,
      "text": "也没有满山庙宇的香火味，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00008",
      "start_ms": 24090,
      "end_ms": 26670,
      "text": "却用一位大先生的学问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00009",
      "start_ms": 26670,
      "end_ms": 30480,
      "text": "让山里一草一木都有了几摇头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00010",
      "start_ms": 30880,
      "end_ms": 32800,
      "text": "老规矩开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00011",
      "start_ms": 32820,
      "end_ms": 34840,
      "text": "劳烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00012",
      "start_ms": 35260,
      "end_ms": 36340,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00013",
      "start_ms": 36340,
      "end_ms": 38900,
      "text": "在听第五名五台山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00014",
      "start_ms": 39300,
      "end_ms": 41720,
      "text": "山西忻州五台山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00015",
      "start_ms": 41720,
      "end_ms": 44720,
      "text": "您一定听过中国佛教四大名山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00016",
      "start_ms": 44940,
      "end_ms": 47100,
      "text": "他排头一个五座台，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00017",
      "start_ms": 47100,
      "end_ms": 49380,
      "text": "顶平平的像五只，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00018",
      "start_ms": 49400,
      "end_ms": 50580,
      "text": "托着天的手掌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00019",
      "start_ms": 51240,
      "end_ms": 54040,
      "text": "北台夜斗峰三千零六十一米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00020",
      "start_ms": 54360,
      "end_ms": 55600,
      "text": "是华北屋脊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00021",
      "start_ms": 56000,
      "end_ms": 58360,
      "text": "相传这里是文殊菩萨的道场。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00022",
      "start_ms": 58980,
      "end_ms": 60855,
      "text": "东汉就有人盖世，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00023",
      "start_ms": 61710,
      "end_ms": 63335,
      "text": "唐朝最盛的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00024",
      "start_ms": 63680,
      "end_ms": 65455,
      "text": "山里三百多座寺院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00025",
      "start_ms": 66070,
      "end_ms": 67675,
      "text": "今天还有四十多座。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00026",
      "start_ms": 68120,
      "end_ms": 71130,
      "text": "您夏天上山山下热的冒汗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00027",
      "start_ms": 71470,
      "end_ms": 72310,
      "text": "到了台顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00028",
      "start_ms": 72450,
      "end_ms": 75275,
      "text": "凉风一吹才懂他为什么叫清凉山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00029",
      "start_ms": 75650,
      "end_ms": 77135,
      "text": "山里的南禅寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00030",
      "start_ms": 77770,
      "end_ms": 79935,
      "text": "是一座唐朝的木头大殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00031",
      "start_ms": 80420,
      "end_ms": 81675,
      "text": "一千两百多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00032",
      "start_ms": 82280,
      "end_ms": 85405,
      "text": "是中国现存最老的木结构建筑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00033",
      "start_ms": 85870,
      "end_ms": 88775,
      "text": "别处的唐朝早成了书里的字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00034",
      "start_ms": 89320,
      "end_ms": 91965,
      "text": "这儿的唐朝还稳稳立着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00035",
      "start_ms": 92330,
      "end_ms": 92670,
      "text": "您说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00036",
      "start_ms": 92670,
      "end_ms": 93955,
      "text": "这是不是活的历史？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00037",
      "start_ms": 94330,
      "end_ms": 94950,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00038",
      "start_ms": 95430,
      "end_ms": 97365,
      "text": "嵩山、河南郑州。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00039",
      "start_ms": 97840,
      "end_ms": 100525,
      "text": "很多人以为嵩山就是个练少林武功的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00040",
      "start_ms": 100930,
      "end_ms": 104940,
      "text": "其实他真正厉害的底色是儒释道三家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00041",
      "start_ms": 105200,
      "end_ms": 107415,
      "text": "在咱们中原府第扎下的老根，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00042",
      "start_ms": 107880,
      "end_ms": 111720,
      "text": "三十六亿年的石头帝制三千多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00043",
      "start_ms": 111820,
      "end_ms": 114015,
      "text": "历朝历代祭天的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00044",
      "start_ms": 114460,
      "end_ms": 118845,
      "text": "全国最早的汉朝石阙砖塔全都在这立着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00045",
      "start_ms": 119320,
      "end_ms": 123780,
      "text": "您要是站在中岳庙又大又红的宫墙和大柏树底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00046",
      "start_ms": 124120,
      "end_ms": 126490,
      "text": "脚踩的老砖头耳朵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00047",
      "start_ms": 126530,
      "end_ms": 129365,
      "text": "听着少林寺远远传来的撞钟声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00048",
      "start_ms": 129860,
      "end_ms": 133515,
      "text": "闭上眼就能摸到咱们老祖宗那股厚重的脉搏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00049",
      "start_ms": 133990,
      "end_ms": 138640,
      "text": "少林寺在这开创了禅宗宋朝的大先生们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00050",
      "start_ms": 138640,
      "end_ms": 141385,
      "text": "在松阳书院摆开桌子讲学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00051",
      "start_ms": 142150,
      "end_ms": 143125,
      "text": "读书明理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00052",
      "start_ms": 143520,
      "end_ms": 144540,
      "text": "修心修德，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00053",
      "start_ms": 144900,
      "end_ms": 147015,
      "text": "全在这磨合了上千年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00054",
      "start_ms": 147800,
      "end_ms": 150660,
      "text": "成了天地当中最稳当的一座文化。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00055",
      "start_ms": 150740,
      "end_ms": 151495,
      "text": "大靠山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00056",
      "start_ms": 151840,
      "end_ms": 152595,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00057",
      "start_ms": 152980,
      "end_ms": 154845,
      "text": "武当山湖北十堰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00058",
      "start_ms": 155840,
      "end_ms": 157925,
      "text": "如果说嵩山是三家同住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00059",
      "start_ms": 158570,
      "end_ms": 159170,
      "text": "武当山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00060",
      "start_ms": 159170,
      "end_ms": 161425,
      "text": "就是把整座山修成一座道观。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00061",
      "start_ms": 161840,
      "end_ms": 162620,
      "text": "明朝永乐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00062",
      "start_ms": 162620,
      "end_ms": 164845,
      "text": "十年朱棣一声令下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00063",
      "start_ms": 165270,
      "end_ms": 166645,
      "text": "征调三十万人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00064",
      "start_ms": 167040,
      "end_ms": 167940,
      "text": "修了十二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00065",
      "start_ms": 168200,
      "end_ms": 170875,
      "text": "在七十二封之间盖起九宫八卦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00066",
      "start_ms": 171620,
      "end_ms": 172565,
      "text": "当年有句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00067",
      "start_ms": 172940,
      "end_ms": 175510,
      "text": "北建紫禁城难修，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00068",
      "start_ms": 175670,
      "end_ms": 178225,
      "text": "武当主封天柱峰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00069",
      "start_ms": 178730,
      "end_ms": 182335,
      "text": "一千六百多米峰顶立的一座金殿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00070",
      "start_ms": 182780,
      "end_ms": 186020,
      "text": "通体铜铸鎏金六百多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00071",
      "start_ms": 186020,
      "end_ms": 186575,
      "text": "过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00072",
      "start_ms": 187050,
      "end_ms": 190510,
      "text": "雷雨天常被雷火裹住变身，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00073",
      "start_ms": 190730,
      "end_ms": 192690,
      "text": "却一点没坏人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00074",
      "start_ms": 192690,
      "end_ms": 194155,
      "text": "叫他雷火练电。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00075",
      "start_ms": 194630,
      "end_ms": 197060,
      "text": "您顺着山路往上公关，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00076",
      "start_ms": 197120,
      "end_ms": 200695,
      "text": "一座接一座藏在悬崖和山坳里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00077",
      "start_ms": 201060,
      "end_ms": 203225,
      "text": "跟山的形状严丝合缝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00078",
      "start_ms": 203760,
      "end_ms": 207845,
      "text": "一座山被一个王朝拿国力雕成了一件作品，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00079",
      "start_ms": 208270,
      "end_ms": 211725,
      "text": "您说这气魄当不当得起文化二字？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00080",
      "start_ms": 212160,
      "end_ms": 212815,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00081",
      "start_ms": 213320,
      "end_ms": 215475,
      "text": "泰山山东泰安。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00082",
      "start_ms": 216250,
      "end_ms": 217205,
      "text": "论名气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00083",
      "start_ms": 217530,
      "end_ms": 218195,
      "text": "论地位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00084",
      "start_ms": 218910,
      "end_ms": 221025,
      "text": "很多人以为第一名非他莫属，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00085",
      "start_ms": 221510,
      "end_ms": 222470,
      "text": "五岳之首，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00086",
      "start_ms": 222750,
      "end_ms": 225045,
      "text": "海拔一千五百四十五米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00087",
      "start_ms": 225390,
      "end_ms": 226245,
      "text": "不算最高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00088",
      "start_ms": 226840,
      "end_ms": 230040,
      "text": "可从秦始皇开始一代代帝王，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00089",
      "start_ms": 230180,
      "end_ms": 233590,
      "text": "排着队上山封禅汉武帝去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00090",
      "start_ms": 233590,
      "end_ms": 235795,
      "text": "好几趟唐玄宗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00091",
      "start_ms": 236160,
      "end_ms": 237925,
      "text": "宋真宗也都去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00092",
      "start_ms": 238360,
      "end_ms": 238940,
      "text": "孔子说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00093",
      "start_ms": 238960,
      "end_ms": 240855,
      "text": "登太山而小天下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00094",
      "start_ms": 241300,
      "end_ms": 242200,
      "text": "杜甫望着他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00095",
      "start_ms": 242260,
      "end_ms": 243925,
      "text": "写下一览众山小，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00096",
      "start_ms": 244360,
      "end_ms": 246415,
      "text": "山上磨牙石刻一千多处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00097",
      "start_ms": 247280,
      "end_ms": 248900,
      "text": "从山脚到山顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00098",
      "start_ms": 249220,
      "end_ms": 250565,
      "text": "六千多级台阶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00099",
      "start_ms": 251410,
      "end_ms": 253095,
      "text": "您一步一步往上爬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00100",
      "start_ms": 253850,
      "end_ms": 255145,
      "text": "腿酸的直打颤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00101",
      "start_ms": 255720,
      "end_ms": 256755,
      "text": "爬到玉皇顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00102",
      "start_ms": 257170,
      "end_ms": 257975,
      "text": "日出一漏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00103",
      "start_ms": 258420,
      "end_ms": 259365,
      "text": "什么泪都忘了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00104",
      "start_ms": 259830,
      "end_ms": 261615,
      "text": "别的山是拿来看的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00105",
      "start_ms": 261940,
      "end_ms": 263925,
      "text": "泰山是拿来托付的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00106",
      "start_ms": 264620,
      "end_ms": 271155,
      "text": "历代人把对天对国、对自己的叛头一块块刻在了山石上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00107",
      "start_ms": 271550,
      "end_ms": 275095,
      "text": "一座山成了一个民族的精神靠山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00108",
      "start_ms": 275630,
      "end_ms": 277845,
      "text": "您说这分量重不重？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00109",
      "start_ms": 278280,
      "end_ms": 279955,
      "text": "那第一名到底是哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00110",
      "start_ms": 280220,
      "end_ms": 280955,
      "text": "先别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00111",
      "start_ms": 281630,
      "end_ms": 282355,
      "text": "聊到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00112",
      "start_ms": 282610,
      "end_ms": 284135,
      "text": "我先唠几句心里话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00113",
      "start_ms": 284550,
      "end_ms": 287340,
      "text": "我发现经常有朋友留言说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00114",
      "start_ms": 287360,
      "end_ms": 288320,
      "text": "年轻时候忙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00115",
      "start_ms": 288660,
      "end_ms": 289735,
      "text": "没空出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00116",
      "start_ms": 290300,
      "end_ms": 292100,
      "text": "现在退休有空了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00117",
      "start_ms": 292220,
      "end_ms": 293305,
      "text": "想去走走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00118",
      "start_ms": 293710,
      "end_ms": 295860,
      "text": "可不知道先去哪儿去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00119",
      "start_ms": 295960,
      "end_ms": 296745,
      "text": "看什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00120",
      "start_ms": 297160,
      "end_ms": 298945,
      "text": "还有朋友说年纪上来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00121",
      "start_ms": 299390,
      "end_ms": 301935,
      "text": "泰山、黄山这样的台阶爬不动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00122",
      "start_ms": 302770,
      "end_ms": 304170,
      "text": "有没有不用费劲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00123",
      "start_ms": 304210,
      "end_ms": 306105,
      "text": "爬山也能看懂的名声。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00124",
      "start_ms": 306610,
      "end_ms": 308290,
      "text": "还有带孙子孙女儿的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00125",
      "start_ms": 308490,
      "end_ms": 312130,
      "text": "想给孩子讲讲这些山水背后的古人典故，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00126",
      "start_ms": 312810,
      "end_ms": 313990,
      "text": "可自己也说不全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00127",
      "start_ms": 314770,
      "end_ms": 316970,
      "text": "您看咱们这个年纪看景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00128",
      "start_ms": 316990,
      "end_ms": 318410,
      "text": "不光是图个热闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00129",
      "start_ms": 318850,
      "end_ms": 321870,
      "text": "更想知道这背后有什么文化讲究。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00130",
      "start_ms": 322350,
      "end_ms": 325470,
      "text": "可这些东西在手机上划完就忘上网，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00131",
      "start_ms": 325530,
      "end_ms": 328190,
      "text": "查一堆乱七八糟的翻大部头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00132",
      "start_ms": 328190,
      "end_ms": 330070,
      "text": "史书又看的眼睛疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00133",
      "start_ms": 330530,
      "end_ms": 332170,
      "text": "前阵子我翻到一本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00134",
      "start_ms": 332590,
      "end_ms": 334090,
      "text": "正好解决这个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00135",
      "start_ms": 334410,
      "end_ms": 339500,
      "text": "叫大美中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00136",
      "start_ms": 339860,
      "end_ms": 344020,
      "text": "他把全中国最值得去的一百零一个地方挑出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00137",
      "start_ms": 344560,
      "end_ms": 347080,
      "text": "分成五块自然奇观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00138",
      "start_ms": 347520,
      "end_ms": 349520,
      "text": "文明印记、烟火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00139",
      "start_ms": 349540,
      "end_ms": 350900,
      "text": "人间秘境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00140",
      "start_ms": 350940,
      "end_ms": 351440,
      "text": "寻踪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00141",
      "start_ms": 351740,
      "end_ms": 352600,
      "text": "人间天堂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00142",
      "start_ms": 352600,
      "end_ms": 356300,
      "text": "咱们今天聊的这些名山书里头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00143",
      "start_ms": 356300,
      "end_ms": 357900,
      "text": "一个地方接一个地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00144",
      "start_ms": 357900,
      "end_ms": 359520,
      "text": "讲怎么来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00145",
      "start_ms": 359520,
      "end_ms": 360800,
      "text": "有什么典故？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00146",
      "start_ms": 360820,
      "end_ms": 363500,
      "text": "帝王在这儿干了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00147",
      "start_ms": 363900,
      "end_ms": 367285,
      "text": "文人墨客又在这儿寄托了什么心性，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00148",
      "start_ms": 367840,
      "end_ms": 368500,
      "text": "几分钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00149",
      "start_ms": 368580,
      "end_ms": 371115,
      "text": "一个地方讲的明明白白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00150",
      "start_ms": 371850,
      "end_ms": 373435,
      "text": "呼印的特别透亮。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00151",
      "start_ms": 374100,
      "end_ms": 376545,
      "text": "一页翻开就是一幅大画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00152",
      "start_ms": 377070,
      "end_ms": 378425,
      "text": "我自己是这么用的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00153",
      "start_ms": 379100,
      "end_ms": 382820,
      "text": "能去的地方出门前翻一翻到了地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00154",
      "start_ms": 382880,
      "end_ms": 383675,
      "text": "心里有底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00155",
      "start_ms": 384180,
      "end_ms": 385795,
      "text": "看的就不是冷石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00156",
      "start_ms": 386260,
      "end_ms": 388995,
      "text": "是活故事暂时去不了的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00157",
      "start_ms": 389460,
      "end_ms": 391105,
      "text": "就着图文慢慢看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00158",
      "start_ms": 391420,
      "end_ms": 392545,
      "text": "也算去过了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00159",
      "start_ms": 393280,
      "end_ms": 394495,
      "text": "摆在茶几上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00160",
      "start_ms": 395020,
      "end_ms": 395860,
      "text": "孙辈来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00161",
      "start_ms": 395860,
      "end_ms": 396560,
      "text": "翻两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00162",
      "start_ms": 396820,
      "end_ms": 397980,
      "text": "长见识不说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00163",
      "start_ms": 398520,
      "end_ms": 400805,
      "text": "写作文也正好用得上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00164",
      "start_ms": 401200,
      "end_ms": 404030,
      "text": "老两口晚上翻翻商量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00165",
      "start_ms": 404110,
      "end_ms": 407415,
      "text": "明年去哪儿比刷手机舒坦多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00166",
      "start_ms": 407820,
      "end_ms": 410055,
      "text": "房子会旧积蓄会花完。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00167",
      "start_ms": 410520,
      "end_ms": 412895,
      "text": "可老祖宗留下来的文化底蕴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00168",
      "start_ms": 413250,
      "end_ms": 415505,
      "text": "传多少代都贬不了职，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00169",
      "start_ms": 415950,
      "end_ms": 417375,
      "text": "这根脉一旦断了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00170",
      "start_ms": 417730,
      "end_ms": 418675,
      "text": "可就不好接了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00171",
      "start_ms": 419340,
      "end_ms": 421900,
      "text": "趁现在还能买到给自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00172",
      "start_ms": 421960,
      "end_ms": 423905,
      "text": "也给下一代留一份儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00173",
      "start_ms": 424550,
      "end_ms": 426225,
      "text": "说我搁商品橱窗了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00174",
      "start_ms": 426830,
      "end_ms": 429295,
      "text": "感兴趣的朋友点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00175",
      "start_ms": 429580,
      "end_ms": 431115,
      "text": "进入主页进去看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00176",
      "start_ms": 431630,
      "end_ms": 433235,
      "text": "暂时走不出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00177",
      "start_ms": 434050,
      "end_ms": 436645,
      "text": "咱就把大好河山装进屋里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00178",
      "start_ms": 437030,
      "end_ms": 439730,
      "text": "好说回正题揭晓。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00179",
      "start_ms": 439750,
      "end_ms": 440375,
      "text": "第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00180",
      "start_ms": 440800,
      "end_ms": 441535,
      "text": "武夷山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00181",
      "start_ms": 441970,
      "end_ms": 442875,
      "text": "福建南平，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00182",
      "start_ms": 443710,
      "end_ms": 446635,
      "text": "为什么是他他不在五岳之列？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00183",
      "start_ms": 447270,
      "end_ms": 450385,
      "text": "没有一位帝王在他头上封过禅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00184",
      "start_ms": 450930,
      "end_ms": 453885,
      "text": "可前面九座山各占一块的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00185",
      "start_ms": 454430,
      "end_ms": 457195,
      "text": "他一座山全装下了南宋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00186",
      "start_ms": 457590,
      "end_ms": 459505,
      "text": "一位叫朱熹的读书人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00187",
      "start_ms": 460270,
      "end_ms": 462775,
      "text": "在山里舞曲的大饮屏风下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00188",
      "start_ms": 463110,
      "end_ms": 465895,
      "text": "盖起武夷京社收徒讲学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00189",
      "start_ms": 466330,
      "end_ms": 468515,
      "text": "还写下十首五一诏歌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00190",
      "start_ms": 469080,
      "end_ms": 471605,
      "text": "他在这儿讲的学问就是理学。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00191",
      "start_ms": 472020,
      "end_ms": 472460,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00192",
      "start_ms": 472520,
      "end_ms": 477475,
      "text": "他著的四叔从元朝起成了科举考场的标准，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00193",
      "start_ms": 477950,
      "end_ms": 479125,
      "text": "一直管到清末，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00194",
      "start_ms": 479590,
      "end_ms": 480565,
      "text": "将近六百年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00195",
      "start_ms": 481110,
      "end_ms": 484185,
      "text": "中国的读书人没有一个绕的过去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00196",
      "start_ms": 484670,
      "end_ms": 486815,
      "text": "可武夷山不只是书斋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00197",
      "start_ms": 487220,
      "end_ms": 495315,
      "text": "九曲溪绕着三十六封九十九颜留山崖上刻着四百多处古人留下的字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00198",
      "start_ms": 495910,
      "end_ms": 500825,
      "text": "宋朝、苏轼、范仲淹都写诗夸过他的茶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00199",
      "start_ms": 501290,
      "end_ms": 506325,
      "text": "元朝朝廷干脆在山里设了御茶园红茶的鼻祖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00200",
      "start_ms": 506640,
      "end_ms": 509405,
      "text": "正山小主也是从这山里出来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00201",
      "start_ms": 509820,
      "end_ms": 510980,
      "text": "您坐上竹筏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00202",
      "start_ms": 511400,
      "end_ms": 513460,
      "text": "顺着九曲溪飘下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00203",
      "start_ms": 513820,
      "end_ms": 514700,
      "text": "一边是山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00204",
      "start_ms": 515020,
      "end_ms": 516015,
      "text": "一边是水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00205",
      "start_ms": 516480,
      "end_ms": 518200,
      "text": "手里端着一杯颜茶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00206",
      "start_ms": 518600,
      "end_ms": 520065,
      "text": "抬头是食客。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00207",
      "start_ms": 520410,
      "end_ms": 528990,
      "text": "耳边仿佛有人在念书、读书、喝茶、写诗、刻字看山不是一样一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00208",
      "start_ms": 528990,
      "end_ms": 531475,
      "text": "摆的是全藏在了一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00209",
      "start_ms": 532240,
      "end_ms": 533260,
      "text": "一九九九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00210",
      "start_ms": 533620,
      "end_ms": 536795,
      "text": "他被列为世界文化与自然双遗产。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00211",
      "start_ms": 537230,
      "end_ms": 538105,
      "text": "他排第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00212",
      "start_ms": 538470,
      "end_ms": 540155,
      "text": "不是因为名气最大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00213",
      "start_ms": 540600,
      "end_ms": 542205,
      "text": "而是因为他最完整。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00214",
      "start_ms": 543070,
      "end_ms": 544785,
      "text": "别的山是文化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00215",
      "start_ms": 545380,
      "end_ms": 546545,
      "text": "住进了山里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00216",
      "start_ms": 546840,
      "end_ms": 549215,
      "text": "武夷山是山和文化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00217",
      "start_ms": 549620,
      "end_ms": 551205,
      "text": "长成了彼此的样子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00218",
      "start_ms": 551580,
      "end_ms": 554350,
      "text": "从十座山讲完了黄山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00219",
      "start_ms": 554350,
      "end_ms": 556025,
      "text": "让画家拜他为师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00220",
      "start_ms": 556460,
      "end_ms": 559615,
      "text": "雁荡山被沈括读出了山水的道理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00221",
      "start_ms": 560160,
      "end_ms": 561860,
      "text": "天台山容下了佛道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00222",
      "start_ms": 561860,
      "end_ms": 566350,
      "text": "两家青城山把清净修成了安庐山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00223",
      "start_ms": 566370,
      "end_ms": 568445,
      "text": "一座山装了半部尸史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00224",
      "start_ms": 568830,
      "end_ms": 572620,
      "text": "五台山立的一千两百年的唐朝嵩山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00225",
      "start_ms": 572660,
      "end_ms": 575200,
      "text": "让佛道如同住武当山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00226",
      "start_ms": 575260,
      "end_ms": 576200,
      "text": "是一个王朝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00227",
      "start_ms": 576260,
      "end_ms": 578810,
      "text": "拿国力雕出来的泰山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00228",
      "start_ms": 578810,
      "end_ms": 581055,
      "text": "是一个民族的精神靠山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00229",
      "start_ms": 581470,
      "end_ms": 584095,
      "text": "可只有武夷山没有风扇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00230",
      "start_ms": 584860,
      "end_ms": 585975,
      "text": "不靠帝王，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00231",
      "start_ms": 586450,
      "end_ms": 592275,
      "text": "确把理学、茶、诗文、石刻和山水包在了一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00232",
      "start_ms": 592680,
      "end_ms": 596265,
      "text": "前面几座山比的是名气是四冠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00233",
      "start_ms": 596630,
      "end_ms": 597775,
      "text": "是谁来过？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00234",
      "start_ms": 598110,
      "end_ms": 599425,
      "text": "他比的是文化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00235",
      "start_ms": 599860,
      "end_ms": 602045,
      "text": "有没有长进山的骨头里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00236",
      "start_ms": 602380,
      "end_ms": 604445,
      "text": "您说什么才叫文化气息？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00237",
      "start_ms": 604920,
      "end_ms": 607505,
      "text": "山不是因为有名才有文化气息，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00238",
      "start_ms": 607960,
      "end_ms": 611580,
      "text": "是因为有人把心安在了里山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00239",
      "start_ms": 611620,
      "end_ms": 613685,
      "text": "也把人养成了他的样子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00240",
      "start_ms": 614500,
      "end_ms": 615335,
      "text": "最后问问您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00241",
      "start_ms": 615930,
      "end_ms": 617295,
      "text": "这十座名山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00242",
      "start_ms": 617830,
      "end_ms": 619315,
      "text": "您去过哪几座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00243",
      "start_ms": 619880,
      "end_ms": 621715,
      "text": "最想去的是哪一座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00244",
      "start_ms": 622130,
      "end_ms": 623965,
      "text": "刚才说的那本大美中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00245",
      "start_ms": 624340,
      "end_ms": 626025,
      "text": "我哥商品橱窗了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00246",
      "start_ms": 626360,
      "end_ms": 627620,
      "text": "点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00247",
      "start_ms": 627880,
      "end_ms": 631735,
      "text": "进入主页里就能找到喜欢山水文化的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00248",
      "start_ms": 631930,
      "end_ms": 632585,
      "text": "别错过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00249",
      "start_ms": 633040,
      "end_ms": 635995,
      "text": "想听更多藏在山水里的中国故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00250",
      "start_ms": 636340,
      "end_ms": 637175,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_92529a7c361c461e_s00251",
      "start_ms": 637570,
      "end_ms": 639035,
      "text": "咱们下回接着聊。"
    }
  ],
